## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s HudManager|r 1.0.2
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Keeps the settings of the PB's HUD add-ons in three named sets and switches all of them at once. Save what every installed add-on is set to right now under a name, then load it later; loading writes the saved values back and reloads the UI so every add-on starts from them. Covers ResourceAndSkillBarCustomizer, Clock, ChatWindowCustomizer, CyrodiilAlert, MiniMap, NamePlateChanger and QuestTrackerFontChanger -- whichever of them are installed. Settings panel, or /pbhud.
## Version: 1.0.2
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106 PBsConsoleHudCustomizer PBsClock PBsChatWindowCustomizer PBsCyrodiilAlert PBsMiniMap PBsNamePlateChanger PBsQuestTrackerFontChanger
## SavedVariables: PBsHudManager_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Core.lua
Settings.lua
Main.lua

